</div>

<div class="theme-card" id="indian-languages">
  <div class="theme-img"><img src="http://localhost:4000/images/pubpic/web_paper_highlights_project_boli.png" alt="Speech and language technology for Indian languages" loading="lazy" /></div>
  <div class="theme-text">
    <h3><span data-l="en">Speech and language technology for Indian languages</span><span data-l="hi" lang="hi">भारतीय भाषाओं के लिए वाणी एवं भाषा प्रौद्योगिकी</span></h3>
    <p class="theme-lead-hi" data-l="hi" lang="hi">हकलाहट, स्वर-सामंजस्य और कम संसाधन वाली भारतीय भाषाओं के लिए डेटासेट और मॉडल।</p>
    <p>India speaks in hundreds of languages, and most of them are low-resourced for speech technology. We build datasets and models that respect this diversity: Boli, a multilingual dataset for understanding the stuttering experience; generative models that learn the vowel harmony of Assamese from raw audio; phonology-informed evaluation of multilingual text-to-speech; and, in a SERB-funded project, normative nasalance and acoustic characteristics of North-Eastern languages for language technology and speech therapy.</p>

    <div class="tags"><span>Indian languages</span><span>stuttering</span><span>phonology</span><span>generative models</span><span>text-to-speech</span><span>datasets</span></div>
    
