<div class="theme-card" id="climate">
  <div class="theme-img"><img src="http://localhost:4000/images/slider7001400/web_audio_signals.png" alt="Data analysis for climate sciences" loading="lazy" /></div>
  <div class="theme-text">
    <h3><span data-l="en">Data analysis for climate sciences</span><span data-l="hi" lang="hi">जलवायु विज्ञान के लिए डेटा विश्लेषण</span></h3>
    <p class="theme-lead-hi" data-l="hi" lang="hi">मौसम और जलवायु के प्रति जंगल की प्रतिक्रिया को उसकी ध्वनियों से समझना।</p>
    <p>The cacophony of sounds in a forest draws contributions from many species, natural phenomena such as wind, rain, and thunder, and man-made vehicles and machines. Building on this observation, we intend to design ways to monitor a forest’s response to changing weather and climate conditions, allowing prediction of adversities. This is a long-term effort involving several hypotheses and sub-problems. We are also analyzing satellite imagery for climate and weather monitoring.</p>

